commit 87795b48da7ba967a4914be5ba136374d7a69dd0
Merge: 84e902c 50cf02e
Author: rrios <dowiyogo@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Sep 1 14:23:09 2026 +0200

    merge: adopt Phase-7 optics and SSLG4 material framework from feat/bar-end-vikuiti
    
    Supersedes 84e902c (G4LogicalSkinSurface on BarLV), which eliminated TIR
    and caused the ~1500x photon deficit. The air-group-velocity problem that
    84e902c correctly identified is solved by the two-layer geometry:
    explicit 0.10 mm air gap + 0.05 mm Mylar reflector, with
    GROUPVEL_air = c/n_bar.

